.github
.env
.env.*
backups
datasets
docs
e2e
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/media
backend/media_e2e
backend/staticfiles
